# Date words that alone take a more frequent non-date sense. A preposition,
# demonstrative, number or year beside the word keeps the date sense.
# august: adjective "ophøjet, værdig" (Den Danske Ordbog "august", adjektiv),
# and a male first name. maj: a female first name (Den Danske Ordbog "Maj").
# The month takes a preposition, a day number or a year: "i august",
# "den 3. maj", "maj 2020".
august
maj
